@EmployeeApi.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### Get all employees
GET {{EmployeeApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

### Create an employee
POST {{EmployeeApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "salary": 65000,
  "dept": "IT"
}

### Delete an employee (replace 1 with a real id)
DELETE {{EmployeeApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
